OL,3,GNEWSAWhy dogs are being given freedom
OL,4,Ato roam on capital's beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FDogs are set to be given the freedom of
OL,7,Fthe shoreline in the Isle of Man's
OL,8,Fcapital for the next year.
OL,10,FUnder a 12-month trial, seasonal
OL,11,Frestrictions in place on walking dogs
OL,12,Fon Douglas Beach will be lifted.
OL,14,FDouglas Council said the change was on
OL,15,Fthe proviso that owners picked up after
OL,16,Ftheir pets and remained in control of
OL,17,Fthem at all times.
OL,19,FUnder the trial, Douglas dog walkers
OL,20,Fcan access the beach all year round `
OL,21,Fat any time of day ` with their pets.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
